# Boundary guard: from-json is not in prelude (requires include of codecs/json.llt).
# Type checker and eval both see from-json as undefined (E002). Note: if from-json
# were available, this would test CALL-MONO boundary guard — from-json returns Unknown,
# function expects Int, so the Int guard would fire at runtime on a non-Int value.
[call [fn [let x@Int] x] [from-json "\"hello\""]]
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: from-json (defined at 4:27-4:36)
